# VectorCraft's .gitignore leaves out every folder named plan/, its local notes. Moved into its repository as
# stitchcraft/ (ADR-0011), our docs' plan/ would be left out with them; this rule, nearer, keeps it. The
# compatibility gate's move job checks that VectorCraft's git keeps every file of ours.
!/docs/src/plan/
